# The binaries `go build ./cmd/...` drops in the repository root. ⛔ None of
# these was ignored, and `bk` — this command's old name — sat in HEAD for three
# months at 19 771 746 bytes (10 575 333 on disk, of a ~15 MiB .git), referenced
# by nothing. Anchored with a leading slash so only the root build output is
# ignored, never a directory or a source file that happens to share the name.
/bk
/zbk
/zpkb
/venvlaunch
